                        "biography": "Andres spent his youth living among Nighon's Troglodytes. The absolute darkness and the feral environment drove him to the brink of madness, making him sometimes go crazy. Legend says that as a child, he was locked in a dark room full of rats, and that is why he lost his mind—or so it is believed. His friendship with Gunnar only improved his madness. He now moves and acts with an erratic speed, turning every battle into an ambush.",
